Origin of third-party material
------------------------------
Version 2.0 and later is a rewrite from scratch. The following data (no code)
comes from the older addon of the same name that ships with the AzerothCore
module mod-transmog-plus (addon/Transmog; the module is licensed AGPL-3.0, the
addon is a port by malinmr of flekz-games/cmangos-transmog, which states
GPL-3.0 on its GitHub page):

  * UI/Cameras.lua: the camera calibration numbers (offsets and rotation
    angles per race and slot) for the tile models, taken over 1:1;
  * Core/Items.lua: the Spanish (esES) names of the weapon and armour
    subclasses (strings of the game client).

The AGPL-3.0 is compatible with the licence of both sources.

The addon contains no media files (textures, sounds, fonts). The sound after
applying is a stock sound of the game client (PlaySound "LOOTWINDOWCOINSOUND");
all textures are stock client textures. World of Warcraft is a trademark of
Blizzard Entertainment, Inc.; this project is not affiliated with Blizzard.

